{
    "config": {
        "name": "Sevastopol Access Terminal",
        "author": "EthanDunning",
        "terminalType": "alien",
        "theme": "green",
        "defaultTextSpeed": 0.8,
        "alien": {
            "system": "SEEGSON",
            "title": "PERSONAL TERMINAL",
            "footerHint": "[↑/↓] NAVIGATE   [←/→] SWITCH LIST   [WHEEL] SCROLL",
            "status": "UPLINK SECURE",
            "showClock": true
        },
        "comment": "Example of the 'alien' terminal skin (Alien: Isolation). A screen with \"layout\": \"folders\" is a three-region view with NO screen transitions: its link elements are the left-hand FOLDER tabs; the selected folder's target screen supplies the top-right list of sub-sections (its own links, or itself if it is a single message); and the selected sub-section's target supplies the content typed into the body. Use ↑/↓ to move within a list, ←/→ (or Enter/Backspace) to switch between the folder list and the sub-section list, or just click. Boot and login screens use the normal flow inside the same chrome."
    },
    "screens": [
        {
            "id": "boot",
            "type": "screen",
            "defaultTextSpeed": 0.6,
            "onDone": { "target": "login", "delayMs": 1400 },
            "content": [
                "",
                { "type": "text", "className": "system", "text": "S E E G S O N" },
                "APOLLO NETWORK ACCESS TERMINAL",
                "MODEL S-8100  /  FIRMWARE 4.7.2",
                "",
                "ESTABLISHING SECURE UPLINK...",
                "LINK ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓  100%",
                { "type": "text", "className": "notice", "text": "CONNECTION ESTABLISHED" }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "login",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                { "type": "text", "className": "system", "text": "AUTHORIZATION REQUIRED" },
                "This terminal is restricted to authorized SEEGSON personnel.",
                "Unauthorized access is logged and reported to station security.",
                "",
                "HINT> OPERATOR / 31161",
                "",
                {
                    "type": "login",
                    "usernamePrompt": "OPERATOR ID> ",
                    "passwordPrompt": "ACCESS CODE> ",
                    "usernameCaseSensitive": false,
                    "credentials": [
                        { "username": "OPERATOR", "password": "31161", "target": "main" }
                    ],
                    "noMatchTarget": "login-fail"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "login-fail",
            "type": "screen",
            "onDone": { "target": "login", "delayMs": 1800 },
            "content": [
                "",
                { "type": "text", "className": "alert", "text": "ACCESS DENIED" },
                "Credentials not recognized. Re-authenticating...",
                ""
            ]
        },

        {
            "id": "main",
            "type": "screen",
            "layout": "folders",
            "content": [
                { "type": "link", "text": "PERSONAL", "target": "msg-nostromo" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "SHARED", "target": "shared" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "PERSONNEL", "target": "personnel" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "SYSTEM", "target": "msg-system" }
            ]
        },

        {
            "id": "msg-nostromo",
            "type": "screen",
            "title": "RE: NOSTROMO INCIDENT",
            "content": [
                "To N. Taylor",
                "RE: Nostromo incident. Case file #DS9398476",
                "",
                "Taylor — I pulled what I could from the archive, but the",
                "incident predates my posting here, so treat the details as",
                "provisional until the sealed records are released.",
                "",
                "In 2122 a commercial hauler went dark on the return leg of a",
                "routine tow. No trace was recovered of the cargo or the crew.",
                "Apart from a late-addition science officer, the complement had",
                "served together on prior contracts — seven in all:",
                "",
                "  DALLAS   - Captain",
                "  KANE     - Executive Officer",
                "  RIPLEY   - Warrant Officer",
                "  LAMBERT  - Navigation Officer",
                "  ASH      - Science Officer",
                "  PARKER   - Chief Engineer",
                "  BRETT    - Engineering Tech",
                "",
                "The company classified the loss and moved on. I'd leave it",
                "there if I were you.",
                "",
                "- R."
            ]
        },

        {
            "id": "shared",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                { "type": "link", "text": "STATION BULLETIN", "target": "msg-bulletin" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "TRANSIT ADVISORY", "target": "msg-transit" }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "msg-bulletin",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                "POSTED TO: ALL PERSONNEL",
                "PRIORITY:  ROUTINE",
                "",
                "The commissary will be closed for restock during third watch.",
                "Recreation deck lighting is on a reduced cycle to conserve",
                "power while the reactor fault is investigated.",
                "",
                "Thank you for your patience.",
                "",
                "- OPERATIONS"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "msg-transit",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                "POSTED TO: ALL PERSONNEL",
                "PRIORITY:  ELEVATED",
                "",
                "The transit line between the upper and lower rings is on a",
                "reduced schedule while diagnostics complete on Junction 7.",
                "Allow extra time for shift changeovers, and report any",
                "malfunction of the car doors to engineering immediately."
            ]
        },

        {
            "id": "personnel",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                { "type": "link", "text": "WAITS, M.", "target": "person-waits" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "TAGHMAOUI, S.", "target": "person-taghmaoui" },
                { "type": "link", "text": "RICARDO, A.", "target": "person-ricardo" }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "person-waits",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                "ROLE......... COLONIAL MARSHAL, SENIOR",
                "CLEARANCE.... TIER 3",
                "STATUS....... ON STATION",
                "",
                "Assigned pending decommission of the station. Notes indicate",
                "rising friction with operations staff over the handling of",
                "the quarantine directive."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "person-taghmaoui",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                "ROLE......... SYSTEMS TECHNICIAN",
                "CLEARANCE.... TIER 2",
                "STATUS....... UNACCOUNTED FOR",
                "",
                "Last logged at Transit Junction 7, lower levels. Did not",
                "report for the following shift. Search request filed and",
                "pending."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "person-ricardo",
            "type": "screen",
            "content": [
                "ROLE......... HULL ENGINEER",
                "CLEARANCE.... TIER 2",
                "STATUS....... ON STATION",
                "",
                "Maintains reactor coolant loops on the SciMed tower. Filed",
                "three overdue maintenance requests this cycle, all unactioned."
            ]
        },

        {
            "id": "msg-system",
            "type": "screen",
            "title": "ENVIRONMENTAL STATUS",
            "content": [
                "ATMOSPHERE..... STABLE",
                "GRAVITY........ 1.0 G NOMINAL",
                "REACTOR........ COOLANT PRESSURE LOW",
                "SECTOR 7....... LIFE SUPPORT OFFLINE",
                "",
                "One or more subsystems require attention. Contact station",
                "engineering to acknowledge active faults. This node cannot",
                "clear alarms remotely."
            ]
        }
    ]
}
